Z||000008||DJRice||01-04-2000||10:20 AM||||I was putting some stuff in my trunk one day and a passer by just couldnt believe that a Pontiac had the engine in the back...||||reg||1
Z||000009||Silver Bullet||01-05-2000||12:32 AM||||I have had this same problem many times.  I thought about putting lil american import on there to, but when I suggested the idea to other people, the most common response was, How could it be an american import?  I swear people in this town are about as sharp a sac of rocks.  Nobody understands good humor anymore.  I also put a sticker on my car that said wrap your ass in fiberglass, and people started asking me what part of my car was fiberglass.  buncha morons!!||||reg||6
Z||000010||Monkeyman||01-05-2000||05:11 AM||||I know that "Wrap your ass in Enduroflex" isn't as catchy as the one you used, but where's the fiberglass on a Fiero?  And I know what "good humor" is.  I've bought many an ice cream from the good humor man in my day!  (Makes me sound old, huh? <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">)||||reg||1
