Z||000025||william_thorniii||01-07-2000||08:11 PM||||Cooter,<P>Although it doesn't really relate to the immediate thread at hand, it does correlate very well about the common misconceptions about our beloved little vehicles.<P>Look at DJ's comment earlier about someones amazement about the Pontiac with the engine in the trunk, and people thinking that our cars are imports....<P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||10
